WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.120
As residents of the District of Rochford,&nbsp;
we all have a responsibility to do whatever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:09.600
is within our power to prevent all&nbsp;
forms of victimization and genocide.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:18.160
The Statement of Commitment will be read by&nbsp;
Councillor Mike Wilkinson. We recognise The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:24.000
Holocaust shook the foundations of modern&nbsp;
civilization. It's unprecedented character&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.920
and horror will always hold universal meaning. We&nbsp;
believe The Holocaust must have a permanent place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:38.240
in our nation's collective memory. We honor the&nbsp;
survivors still with us and reaffirm our shared&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:44.960
goals of mutual understanding and justice. We must&nbsp;
make sure that future generations understand the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:50.800
causes of The Holocaust and reflect upon its&nbsp;
consequences we vow to remember the victims of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:57.760
nazi persecution and of all genocide. We value the&nbsp;
sacrifices of those who have risked their lives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:04.400
to protect or rescue victims, as a touchstone of&nbsp;
the human capacity for good in the face of evil.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:11.840
We recognize that humanity is still scarred&nbsp;
by the belief that race, religion, disability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:18.960
or sexuality makes people's lives&nbsp;
worth less than others. Genocide,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:23.120
anti-semitism, racism, xenophobia&nbsp;
and discrimination still continue.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:29.680
We have shared responsibility to fight these&nbsp;
evils. We pledge to strengthen our efforts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:35.920
to promote education and research about The&nbsp;
Holocaust and other genocide. We will do our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:41.760
utmost to make sure that the lessons of such&nbsp;
events are fully learned. We will continue to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:49.840
encourage Holocaust Remembrance by commemorating&nbsp;
UK Holocaust Memorial Day. We condemn the evils.

